  "_recordings": [
    "CONTIGUOUS ON PURPOSE: each entry starts exactly where the previous one",
    "ended. The library groups segments into sessions by the gap between them,",
    "so five recordings an hour apart are five one-segment sessions -- which is",
    "what a recorder that crashed four times looks like, not what a two-night",
    "archive looks like. Two runs here: last night in three segments, and the",
    "night before in two."
